{
 "_doc": "R29 / A3: Exp-61 fixed-rationale image effect on the zero-reasoning-token subset, per truncation variant.\n\nPair = one Exp-61 prompt with its own truncated reply fixed, answered under v and under the twin v_cf (two calls).\nFor each closed model, set (hard / cue) and variant (removed = primary, kept, strict), counts pairs whose answer calls\nreport reasoning_tokens = 0 in BOTH arms, in the v_cf arm only, and in neither, and the image effect\nIE = P(answer = gold_v | v) - P(answer = gold_v | v_cf) on each subset with a scene-cluster ('group') bootstrap\n(2,000, seed 61; the pair-cluster bootstrap of rigor_e61.py). Parsing and record selection reuse rigor_e61.latest\n(no table is written). Also reproduces the appendix statement 'twin calls with zero reasoning tokens ... 144 pairs /\n23 pairs; pooled over truncation variants' (v_cf arm only, pooled over the three variants; identical bodies share one\nAPI call, so the pooled count double-counts calls when two variants have the same body).\nInputs: a snapshot of outputs/e61/gen_<model>.jsonl (DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash / HY4 were still being generated, Track X1).\n-> outputs/bundle/r29_zero_reasoning.json, outputs/bundle/rigor_r29_zero_reasoning.txt\nUsage: python r29_zero_reasoning.py [--gen-dir /tmp/r29_e61_snapshot]\n",
